## 🔍 Key Insights & Findings

| Metric | Insight |
|---|---|
| 🧮 **Customer Base** | Analysis performed on **1,968 unique customers** derived from **2,245 completed transactions**. |
| 🎯 **Optimal Segments** | Elbow method confirmed **k = 4** as the optimal cluster count for RFM segmentation. |
| 💰 **High-Value Segment** | A distinct cluster of customers showed **higher Frequency & Monetary value** despite moderate Recency — flagged as *Loyal Customers*. |
| ⚠️ **At-Risk Segment** | A large cluster (**972 customers**) exhibited **very high Recency (~1093 days)** and low activity — prime candidates for **re-engagement campaigns**. |
| 🆕 **New/Active Segment** | One cluster showed **low Recency (~156 days)**, indicating **recently active customers** ideal for loyalty nurturing. |
| 📉 **Low-Value Segment** | The smallest-spend cluster averaged **~$21.60 Monetary value**, useful for identifying low-engagement or one-time buyers. |

